{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for a charming and challenging adventure in &quot;Purfect Climb&quot;! In this vertical platformer, you control an agile cat who must climb floating platforms to reach new heights. With a cute theme and relaxing music, each game becomes a unique journey, where each fall makes you start from where you fell, with no checkpoints. How high can you get?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Purfect Climb&quot; combines charming visual elements with a progressive difficulty that will test your skills and patience. Perfect for players who love challenges and roguelike games (but you don't die).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc3e Explore charming scenarios and overcome unpredictable obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 Enjoy a relaxing soundtrack that makes each attempt a new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude80 Beat your own records and share your achievements!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A food for the cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438090/37a1028e4fe88ebab9ebfdd78f15aded0b036281.jpg"},{"name":"A pack of animations","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438090/24a21745ea5b688052b492d19b1ff4c40da8f3a4.jpg"},{"name":"A scratch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438090/9cbf0eab72410bd43c43046cb0c5238bfbb39281.jpg"},{"name":"A fast travel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438090/96b4127a4860f553fb337008abe323f62cad3047.jpg"},{"name":"A licking to clean","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438090/47ec2fcdea855d6efec4c5465b131ea5d6f755a6.jpg"},{"name":"A fast cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3438090/3962f408a16214edf0aa7aa231fceb5ad24963e3.jpg"},{"name":"A faster cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstat